2. When copied, press [ Ok ] in this window to proceed
3. A terminal-window will pop up  ...
4. Switch to that terminal-window and paste the command-text (Ctrl-V)
5. Press enter to run the command-text
6. The PDI/Kettle-job will start it's execution ...
7. Wait until it is finished ...
